WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.487
"Let's go camping," said Dog.

2
00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:17.667
"No thanks," said Bat.

3
00:00:17.668 --> 00:00:20.951
"I don't like camping," said Cow.

4
00:00:20.952 --> 00:00:24.851
"The tent is too small."

5
00:00:24.852 --> 00:00:34.246
"The woods are too dark," said Cat.

6
00:00:34.247 --> 00:00:40.542
"And they are spooky."

7
00:00:40.543 --> 00:00:50.553
"I am a watchdog," said Dog.

8
00:00:50.554 --> 00:00:55.884
"The woods do not scare me."

9
00:00:55.885 --> 00:01:01.433
Nobody wanted to go camping.

10
00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:04.470
"Please?" Dog said.

11
00:01:04.471 --> 00:01:07.900
"Please, can we go?"

12
00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:11.371
"No," said Cow.

13
00:01:11.372 --> 00:01:14.781
"I like the barn," said Cat.

14
00:01:14.782 --> 00:01:20.177
"Maybe next year," said Pig.

15
00:01:20.178 --> 00:01:41.963
Dog gave presents to everyone.

16
00:01:41.964 --> 00:01:52.465
He did nice things for everyone.

17
00:01:52.466 --> 00:02:10.603
Then he tried some silly tricks.

18
00:02:10.604 --> 00:02:13.812
Everyone laughed and laughed.

19
00:02:13.813 --> 00:02:18.995
"Okay, Dog," Cow said at last.

20
00:02:18.996 --> 00:02:21.995
"We will go camping."

21
00:02:21.996 --> 00:02:27.792
"Just one time," said Bat.

22
00:02:27.793 --> 00:02:32.060
"We do not like camping," said Cat.

23
00:02:32.061 --> 00:02:50.120
"Thank you, friends," said Dog.

24
00:02:50.121 --> 00:02:57.612
And off they went.

